  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Presentación y navegación",
      "items": [
        "SplashScreen: animación estacional, audioplayers, icono dinámico y /home/0; HomeScreen: PageView/KeepAlive, Drawer y bottom nav; MovieScreen unifica películas/series.",
        "HomeView: slideshow circular + tres listas; PopularView: MovieMasonry; FavoritesView: filtra MediaId.isSeries. SideMenu ajusta tipo, tema y cinco idiomas."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Contratos, datos y plataforma",
      "items": [
        "DIP: Movies/Actors/LocalStorage Repository y Datasource; impl. delegan a TMDB o Isar. Entidades: Movie (@collection), Actor y Video.",
        "Dio/Environment (flutter_dotenv) → TMDB: /movie/*, /tv/*, /search/*, /similar, /videos, /release_dates, /content_ratings y créditos; fallback en-US. Mappers: MovieMapper, SeriesMapper, ActorMapper y VideoMapper."
      ]
    }
  ]
